<a href="https://decisionstats.com/2014/04/15/installing-scala-on-centos/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">https://decisionstats.com/2014/04/15/installing-scala-on-centos/</a></p>
<p>wget <a href="http://www.scala-lang.org/files/archive/scala-2.10.1.tgz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">http://www.scala-lang.org/files/archive/scala-2.10.1.tgz</a><br>
tar xvf scala-2.10.1.tgz<br>
sudo mv scala-2.10.1 /usr/lib<br>
sudo ln -s /usr/lib/scala-2.10.1 /usr/lib/scala<br>
export PATH=$PATH:/usr/lib/scala/bin<br>
scala -version</p>
